sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant MCPServer
    participant AuthServer

    Client->>MCPServer: GET /.well-known/oauth-protected-resource
    MCPServer-->>Client: scopes_supported [current, forecast]

    Client->>AuthServer: Request token (scope=weather:current)
    AuthServer-->>Client: JWT { scope=weather:current }

    Client->>MCPServer: GET /tools/current (Bearer token)
    MCPServer-->>Client: ✅ Weather data

    Client->>MCPServer: GET /tools/forecast (Bearer token)
    MCPServer-->>Client: ❌ 403 Insufficient scope
